<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51093" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vĭrīlĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		virilis, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>manhood</i> (perh. not ante-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>The age of manhood</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 33,
				12, 54, § 155</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b> Abstr., <i>manhood</i>,
				<i>virility</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Gaiam C. Caesarem, quasi incertae virilitatis,
					dicere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					6, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adempta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 6, 31</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			Concr., <i>the organs of generation</i>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 5,
				12, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 7, 4, 3, § 36</span></i>; cf.
				<i><span class="en">Dig.
				48, 8, 4 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 9,
				7, 5 al.</span></i>—Of animals, <i><span class="en">Col. 6, 26,
				3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 23, 1, 23, §
			44</span></i>.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>manliness</i>, <i>manly vigor</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sanctitas certe. et, ut sic dicam, virilitas ab
					his (veteribus Latinis) petenda, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					1, 8, 9</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Val.
				Max. 2, 4, 2</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
